      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Sahara Kazen — the personal name of a Fukuchiyama domain official. It stands alone in the first name slot of a column with no office label, continuing the officials name list begun on the facing page (printed 四百八), where the last labelled office is 權少參事 (acting junior councillor) with the names 榊原競 and 飯田高明."
      },
      {
