  {
    "id": "anno-fukue_lower_p216_left-11",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "内百五十一人ハ一隊四拾人組ニシテ二小隊同役員及醫師器械掛大炮附屬等ノ常備兵又四百九十三人ハ所々炮臺并浦村兵員集合隊"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "内、百五十一人は一隊四十人組にして二小隊、同役員及び医師・器械掛・大砲附属等の常備兵。又、四百九十三人は所々砲台并びに浦村兵員集合隊。"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Double-column interlinear note on the 640 troops: of these, 151 are standing troops — two platoons organised as forty-man squads, together with the platoon officers, physicians, ordnance officers, artillery attachments and the like; and 493 are the assembled corps drawn from the several coastal batteries and the shore villages. The two components sum to 644, four more than the 640 printed above, an inconsistency in the source itself. Read right sub-column first, then left."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "福江兵員割註"
      }
    ],
